  "details": "It was ONLY icon that shows platform of given avatar that not \"shown\" directly, beside that, theres no SINGLE OTHER WAY to say, what platform avatar made for, without turning it on and seeing if it's still fallback, or its actual avatar.\n\nI don't care if it's moved anywhere else, but theres no any other option or icon that replace deleted one. I can't know what avatar someone use, if it's blocked by safety settings, previously i could decide, if i want to turn it on or off, based on platform, now i can't. It's deletes only feature that allowed that. Bring it back, revert changes.",
